<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Today, I’m sitting down with<a href="https://twitter.com/_anishagnihotri"> <strong>Anish Agnihotri</strong></a>, who is a research associate and colleague of mine at Paradigm. Anish has a fascinating backstory from becoming an entrepreneur at a really young age to later going deep into skin trading. We discuss how that skill transfers to NFT trading and how we see the market structure of both primary and secondary markets for NFTs. Finally, Anish shares some actionable advice on how he learns and how to build projects in crypto. This was a deep and fascinating conversation and I hope you’ll enjoy it.</p>



